      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000334-p000-74d09e9ad1",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "艮卦形如覆碗少有人知，却会五行仔细推演。天上贪狼加武曲，人丁旺盛永远不衰退。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000335-p000-7242a96bc2",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "生气来山立下大名，更临二木好做阡茔。若添水口相回合，子息英雄达帝京。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000336-p000-a5ca2fab5d",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "贪狼远远作来山，艮卦推求亦不难。巽巳尖峰端正揖，富豪官爵出其间。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000337-p000-8250982d25",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "富贵当年说石崇，坎山艮落后遭凶。思量成败非关命，都为来山坐恶龙。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
