      {
        "id": "book001-b000338-p000-4219e9c968",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "阴阳相对起高冈，夫妇恩深义不忘。只恐水流文曲去，投河自缢表贞良。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000339-p000-d19ee4ae7e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "生气天医一样高，半文半武出英豪。不为卿相多为将，后代儿孙佐圣朝。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000340-p000-13ec2c4b5a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "贪狼武曲二山高，瓦屋朱门佩印章。财帛不求多自至，子孙荣贵不寻常。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
